# game/ch02.rpy:12
translate english ch2_7f8e768d:

    # n "周末午后两点，居民楼里的普通家庭卧室。阳光透过半拉的蓝白格子窗帘斜照进来，在地板上投出条状光斑。"
    n "Two in the afternoon on a weekend, in an ordinary family bedroom in a residential building. Sunlight slanted through the half-drawn blue-and-white checkered curtains, casting striped patches of light on the floor."

# game/ch02.rpy:13
translate english ch2_9d18fec7:

    # n "书桌上摊着刚写完的英语作业本、半块卡通橡皮、一杯喝了一半的橙汁，桌边靠着阿狐的双肩书包。房间里安安静静，只有窗外偶尔传来几声蝉鸣。"
    n "On the desk lay his freshly finished English homework, half a cartoon eraser, and a glass of orange juice half drunk, with Ahu's backpack leaning against the desk. The room was quiet, save for the occasional chirp of cicadas outside."

# game/ch02.rpy:14
translate english ch2_949ffc0b:

    # n "阿狐写完作业，后背靠在椅背上伸了个懒腰，随手拿过桌上的手机刷起了短视频，整个人松弛放松，没什么防备心。"
    n "Having finished his homework, Ahu leaned back and stretched, then casually grabbed his phone and started scrolling through short videos — relaxed, with his guard completely down."

# game/ch02.rpy:17
translate english ch2_b326f704:

    # n "指尖漫不经心地滑动手机屏幕，短视频画面快速切换。突然，一条亮黄色封面的视频弹了出来，上面用粗体白字标着「学生专属！零门槛兼职，点赞关注轻松赚零花钱」。"
    n "His fingertip scrolled the screen idly as short videos flicked by. Suddenly, a video with a bright yellow cover popped up, its bold white text reading: \"Students only! Zero-threshold part-time job — earn pocket money by liking and following!\""

# game/ch02.rpy:18
translate english ch2_c5fff2e9:

    # think laugh "还有这种兼职？不用出门，点点赞就能赚钱？刚好想攒钱买新出的文具套装。"
    think laugh "A part-time job like this? I can earn money just by tapping likes without even leaving home? Perfect timing — I've been saving up for that new stationery set."

# game/ch02.rpy:19
translate english ch2_e7aa5bdb:

    # n "视频里反复念着「无押金、无门槛、做完就结、专门给学生做的」，结尾弹出一行字幕：想接单的同学，直接私信客服领任务。"
    n "The video repeated over and over: \"No deposit, no threshold, paid on completion, made just for students.\" At the end, a caption popped up: Students who want to take orders, DM customer service directly to get your task."

# game/ch02.rpy:34
translate english ch2_msg_76003417:

    # n "阿狐依旧坐在卧室书桌前，手机竖放在作业本上，屏幕亮着聊天界面，阳光落在手机边框上。"
    n "Ahu was still at his desk, phone propped upright on his homework, the chat screen glowing as sunlight fell on the phone's frame."

# game/ch02.rpy:35
translate english ch2_msg_5e240957:

    # n "阿狐点进私信按钮，发了一句「怎么接单赚钱？」。不到五秒，一个头像是穿校服的学姐、昵称叫「兼职小助手 - 桐桐」的账号就秒回了消息。"
    n "He tapped the DM button and typed, \"How do I take orders and earn money?\" Within five seconds, an account with a school-uniformed senior's profile picture and the nickname \"Part-time Assistant – Tongtong\" replied instantly."

# game/ch02.rpy:36
translate english ch2_msg_fc4a0008:

    # fraud laugh "同学你好呀！我们是正规的短视频任务平台，专门给初中生、高中生提供兼职，只要给指定视频点赞、关注，一条就能赚 2 块钱，满 5 块马上就能提现到微信，没有任何门槛！"
    fraud laugh "Hi there, classmate! We're a legitimate short-video task platform offering part-time jobs for middle and high school students. Just like and follow the designated videos — 2 yuan per video, and once you hit 5 yuan you can withdraw to WeChat instantly, no threshold at all!"

# game/ch02.rpy:37
translate english ch2_msg_c6d009f3:

    # think laugh "这么简单，还能马上提现，应该不是骗人的吧。"
    think laugh "It's so simple, and I can withdraw right away — it probably isn't a scam."

# game/ch02.rpy:38
translate english ch2_msg_bc915119:

    # n "客服很快发过来三条短视频链接，让阿狐依次点赞关注，截图发回去就能结算。"
    n "Customer service quickly sent three video links, telling Ahu to like and follow each one and send back screenshots to settle up."

# game/ch02.rpy:40
translate english ch2_msg_88ce79b3:

    # n "阿狐飞快划动屏幕做完任务，把截图发过去，对方立刻转了 6 块钱。"
    n "Ahu rushed through the tasks and sent the screenshots — the other side immediately transferred 6 yuan."

# game/ch02.rpy:39
translate english ch2_msg_158caeec:

    # n "阿狐点开提现页面，钱真的马上就到了微信余额里。"
    n "He opened the withdrawal page, and the money really did land in his WeChat balance right away."

# game/ch02.rpy:40
translate english ch2_msg_27e31c94:

    # fraud laugh "同学，基础任务赚得少！现在开通高级任务权限，一单能赚 20 到 50 块，每天花十几分钟，一周就能攒好几百零花钱！只要先垫付 38 块钱激活费，激活之后马上全额退给你，还能优先接高价单！"
    fraud laugh "Classmate, the basic tasks don't pay much! Unlock the advanced-task permission now and you'll earn 20 to 50 yuan per order. Just ten-plus minutes a day and you'll save up hundreds in a week! You just need to advance 38 yuan as an activation fee — it'll be fully refunded right after activation, and you'll get priority on high-paying orders!"

# game/ch02.rpy:54
translate english ch2_ask_mom_a91329aa:

    # n "阿狐拿不准真假，把视频和文案截图发给了在客厅做家务的妈妈。"
    n "Unsure whether it was real, Ahu screenshotted the video and its text and sent them to his mom, who was doing chores in the living room."

# game/ch02.rpy:55
translate english ch2_ask_mom_98dba7bb:

    # n "没两分钟，妈妈擦着手推开卧室门走了进来，眉头微微皱着，表情很认真。"
    n "Within two minutes, Mom wiped her hands, pushed open the bedroom door, and walked in, brows slightly furrowed and looking serious."

# game/ch02.rpy:56
translate english ch2_ask_mom_2c09baba:

    # mom serious "孩子，这种点赞赚钱的都是诈骗套路，上周社区反诈宣传栏刚贴过，学校也应该讲过吧。先给你几块钱当甜头，后面肯定会让你先垫钱，最后直接把你拉黑，专门骗你们这些想赚零花钱的学生。"
    mom serious "Sweetie, these \"earn money by liking\" jobs are all scams. The community anti-fraud board posted about this just last week, and your school must have covered it too. They give you a few yuan as bait first, then they'll definitely make you advance money, and in the end they just block you. They target students like you who want to earn pocket money."

# game/ch02.rpy:57
translate english ch2_ask_mom_49b3f0dd:

    # mc confused "可是它说不用交钱、零门槛啊？"
    mc confused "But it said no payment, zero threshold?"

# game/ch02.rpy:58
translate english ch2_ask_mom_ed3f0ba5:

    # mom serious "骗子就是抓你们想轻松赚钱的心理，先给点小好处勾着你。咱们不贪这点小钱，先把对方拉黑，别跟他们联系。"
    mom serious "Scammers prey on your desire to earn money the easy way — they give you a little benefit to reel you in. Let's not be greedy over such small change. Block them and cut off contact."

# game/ch02.rpy:61
translate english ch2_ask_mom_4f61c34c:

    # n "阿狐听完半信半疑地拉黑了客服账号，但心里还惦记着「轻松赚钱」的事。"
    n "Still half-doubting, Ahu blocked the customer-service account, though the idea of \"easy money\" lingered in his mind."

# game/ch02.rpy:62
translate english ch2_ask_mom_8e158310:

    # n "当天晚饭过后，妈妈特意翻出社区发的反诈宣传手册，翻到「刷单返利诈骗」那一页指给阿狐看——上面的案例和今天遇到的一模一样，骗子都是先用小额任务骗信任，再找理由让受害人垫钱。"
    n "After dinner that day, Mom pulled out the community's anti-fraud handbook and pointed Ahu to the page on \"order-brushing rebate scams\" — the case was exactly the same as today's: scammers first win trust with small tasks, then find excuses to make victims advance money."

# game/ch02.rpy:63
translate english ch2_ask_mom_a70c3d58:

    # think serious "原来真的是骗子啊，还好我没接着做。"
    think serious "So it really was a scam. Good thing I didn't keep going."

# game/ch02.rpy:64
translate english ch2_ask_mom_01abd854:

    # mom normal "以后再看到这种「动动手指就赚钱」的，直接划走，拿不准就问家长和老师。"
    mom normal "From now on, whenever you see something about \"making money with a flick of your finger,\" just swipe it away. If you're not sure, ask your parents or teacher."

# game/ch02.rpy:66
translate english ch2_ask_mom_56e52195:

    # police laugh "你虽然一开始对兼职动了心，但懂得主动求助家长，在反诈宣传的佐证下彻底认清骗局。拿不准就求助长辈，是最靠谱的反诈方式！"
    police laugh "You were tempted by the job at first, but you knew to ask a parent for help, and with the anti-fraud materials you fully saw through the scam. When in doubt, ask an adult — that's the most reliable anti-fraud move!"

# game/ch02.rpy:78
translate english ch2_skip_c289aaa1:

    # n "阿狐扫了一眼视频封面，没多停留，手指一滑就刷走了视频，继续看自己感兴趣的科普内容。"
    n "Ahu glanced at the video cover, didn't linger, and with one swipe skipped past it, continuing to watch science videos he was interested in."

# game/ch02.rpy:79
translate english ch2_skip_2d52dc42:

    # think serious "哪有这么轻松就能赚钱的事，一看就是骗人的，还是老老实实看视频吧。"
    think serious "Nothing earns money that easily — it's obviously a scam. I'll just watch my videos normally."

# game/ch02.rpy:85
translate english ch2_skip_067a95ad:

    # police laugh "你从一开始就识破了诈骗噱头，全程没有接触骗局，反诈意识非常强，从源头守住了财产安全！"
    police laugh "You saw through the scam's hook from the very start and never engaged with it. Your anti-fraud awareness is outstanding — you protected your money at the source!"

# game/ch02.rpy:100
translate english ch2_pay_51e347cf:

    # n "阿狐满脑子都是高价单的收益，想都没想就点开转账界面，指尖停在「确认支付」按钮上，屏幕蓝光映着他有点兴奋的脸。"
    n "His head full of the high-paying orders' rewards, Ahu opened the transfer screen without a second thought, finger hovering over the \"Confirm Payment\" button, the screen's blue glow reflecting off his excited face."

# game/ch02.rpy:101
translate english ch2_pay_ceda92a9:

    # n "阿狐付了 38 块钱。可转账刚显示成功，再发消息就弹出红色感叹号。"
    n "He paid the 38 yuan. But the moment the transfer showed as successful, his next message bounced back with a red exclamation mark."

# game/ch02.rpy:104
translate english ch2_pay_c881f346:

    # n "阿狐刷新页面才发现自己已经被拉黑了，所有任务链接也都点不开了。他一下子慌了，手指反复点着屏幕，身子往前探着，眼眶都有点红了。"
    n "He refreshed the page only to find he'd been blocked, and all the task links no longer opened. Panicking, he tapped the screen over and over, leaning forward, his eyes starting to redden."

# game/ch02.rpy:105
translate english ch2_pay_c9d88809:

    # mc worried "怎么回事？怎么把我拉黑了？我的钱怎么办啊？"
    mc worried "What's going on? Why did they block me? What about my money?!"

# game/ch02.rpy:106
translate english ch2_pay_b06c6aa6:

    # n "阿狐试了好几次重新加好友，都没有回应，确认自己被骗了。他瘫坐在椅子上，手机倒扣在作业本上，心里又慌又后悔，不知所措。"
    n "He tried several times to re-add the friend, but got no response — he'd definitely been scammed. He slumped in his chair, phone flipped face-down on his homework, panicked and regretful, not knowing what to do."

# game/ch02.rpy:120
translate english ch2_ask_teacher_cf47456c:

    # n "阿狐犹豫着拿不定主意，把聊天记录截图发给了班主任。老师很快打来了语音电话，语气严肃又着急。"
    n "Hesitant and unsure, Ahu sent screenshots of the chat to his head teacher. The teacher quickly called back, sounding serious and worried."

# game/ch02.rpy:121
translate english ch2_ask_teacher_a80742fe:

    # teacher serious "这是典型的刷单返利诈骗！咱们上周班会课刚讲过，凡是点赞关注做任务、让你先垫钱的，全是骗子！前面给你的几块钱就是钓鱼的诱饵。"
    teacher serious "This is a classic order-brushing rebate scam! We just covered this in last week's class meeting — anyone who makes you like-and-follow tasks and advance money is a scammer! Those few yuan they gave you first are the bait."

# game/ch02.rpy:122
translate english ch2_ask_teacher_323f7c6b:

    # think serious "原来是这样啊，还好我没转钱，差点就上当了！"
    think serious "So that's what it was. Good thing I didn't transfer — I almost fell for it!"

# game/ch02.rpy:123
translate english ch2_ask_teacher_9e544f54:

    # teacher serious "马上把对方拉黑删掉，以后再看到这种轻松赚钱的兼职，千万别信，拿不准就问老师和家长。"
    teacher serious "Block and delete them right away. From now on, don't ever believe these \"easy money\" jobs — when in doubt, ask your teacher or parents."

# game/ch02.rpy:126
translate english ch2_ask_teacher_0175628f:

    # n "阿狐立刻拉黑了客服，删掉了所有相关链接。"
    n "Ahu immediately blocked the customer service account and deleted all the related links."

# game/ch02.rpy:126
translate english ch2_ask_teacher_4c11e393:

    # police laugh "你在即将转账前及时求助老师，成功止损，掌握了基础的反诈辨别方法！"
    police laugh "You asked your teacher for help just before transferring, successfully stopped the loss — you've mastered the basics of spotting fraud!"

# game/ch02.rpy:142
translate english ch2_refuse_643a2258:

    # n "阿狐皱着眉盯着手机，手指在屏幕上来回划，迟迟没点转账。看着「垫付 38 元」几个字，心里开始打鼓，意识到先交钱肯定有问题，果断回复了对方。"
    n "Ahu frowned at the phone, finger sliding back and forth without tapping transfer. Staring at the words \"advance 38 yuan,\" his heart started pounding — paying money upfront was definitely a red flag — and he firmly replied."

# game/ch02.rpy:143
translate english ch2_refuse_dfbac421:

    # mc serious "我不解锁高级任务，也不会垫付任何钱，以后别发了。"
    mc serious "I won't unlock any advanced tasks, and I won't advance any money. Don't message me again."

# game/ch02.rpy:144
translate english ch2_refuse_55efcd21:

    # n "发完消息，客服并没有罢休，一连发了好多条消息游说：一会儿说激活费可以减半到 18 元，一会儿发别人赚了几百块的截图，一会儿又说「仅限今天的福利，错过就没了」。"
    n "After his reply, customer service didn't give up, bombarding him with persuasion: the activation fee could be cut in half to 18 yuan; here are screenshots of others earning hundreds; it's a today-only deal, miss it and it's gone."

# game/ch02.rpy:145
translate english ch2_refuse_ac002641:

    # think serious "越是催我交钱，越说明是骗局，绝对不能上钩。"
    think serious "The more they push me to pay, the more it proves it's a scam. I absolutely won't take the bait."

# game/ch02.rpy:146
translate english ch2_refuse_5b7cb227:

    # n "阿狐始终没有动摇，见对方一直骚扰，直接一键拉黑了客服，删掉了所有任务链接。"
    n "Ahu never wavered. Fed up with the harassment, he blocked customer service with one tap and deleted all the task links."

# game/ch02.rpy:148
translate english ch2_refuse_095ac7b5:

    # police laugh "你在已经拿到小额返利的情况下，依然能识破垫付陷阱，顶住诱惑果断终止任务，反诈判断十分精准，牢牢守住了自己的财产安全！"
    police laugh "Even after pocketing the small rebate, you still saw through the advance-payment trap, resisted the temptation, and firmly cut off the task. Your anti-fraud judgment was spot-on — you firmly protected your money!"

# game/ch02.rpy:160
translate english ch2_hide_d72b3ae6:

    # n "阿狐默默把手机按黑，低着头抠着作业本的边角，房间里安静得能听见时钟滴答响。"
    n "Ahu silently turned his phone screen off, head down, picking at the corner of his homework. The room was so quiet he could hear the clock ticking."

# game/ch02.rpy:161
translate english ch2_hide_2bb9efe2:

    # n "他害怕被爸妈批评，也觉得说出去很丢人，手忙脚乱地删掉了所有聊天记录、转账记录，把短视频 APP 藏进了文件夹最深处，假装这件事从来没发生过。"
    n "Afraid of being scolded and ashamed to tell anyone, he frantically deleted all the chat and transfer records and hid the short-video app deep inside a folder, pretending it had never happened."

# game/ch02.rpy:162
translate english ch2_hide_add723b2:

    # n "可接下来的几天，阿狐一直心里发慌，上课都忍不住走神，看到手机就想起被骗的事，学校走廊贴的反诈海报，他每次都绕着走，不敢多看。"
    n "But for the next few days, Ahu stayed on edge, zoning out in class and thinking of the scam whenever he saw his phone. He even walked around the anti-fraud posters in the school hallway, too afraid to look."

# game/ch02.rpy:163
translate english ch2_hide_6921e084:

    # n "过了一周实在憋得难受，他才趁着吃饭的时候，小声跟妈妈说了实话。"
    n "After a week, unable to hold it in any longer, he finally whispered the truth to his mom during a meal."

# game/ch02.rpy:164
translate english ch2_hide_d1f656bd:

    # mom normal "孩子，被骗了要第一时间说，藏着掖着不仅找不回钱，还容易憋出心事。"
    mom normal "Sweetie, when you get scammed, you have to say so right away. Hiding it won't get the money back and will only weigh on your heart."

# game/ch02.rpy:166
translate english ch2_hide_957bf3ed:

    # police serious "你因贪小便宜落入骗局，造成了财产损失，还选择隐瞒逃避。被骗不可怕，可怕的是不敢说、不会维权。记住：第一时间告诉家长老师，拨打 110 或 96110！"
    police serious "You fell for the scam out of greed for small gains, suffered a loss, and chose to hide and avoid it. Being scammed isn't what's scary — it's not daring to speak up or knowing how to protect yourself. Remember: tell your parents and teacher right away, and call 110 or 96110!"

# game/ch02.rpy:181
translate english ch2_report_f15a5b6c:

    # n "阿狐深吸一口气，低着头找到妈妈，小声承认了自己被骗的事，把聊天记录和转账凭证都拿给妈妈看。"
    n "Taking a deep breath, Ahu went to his mom with his head down, quietly admitting he'd been scammed and showing her the chat records and transfer receipt."

# game/ch02.rpy:182
translate english ch2_report_b2c85d10:

    # mc sad "妈，我错了，我信了网上的兼职，被骗了 38 块钱。"
    mc sad "Mom, I was wrong. I trusted an online job and got scammed out of 38 yuan."

# game/ch02.rpy:183
translate english ch2_report_bfb9f64a:

    # mom normal "知道错了就行，钱不多没关系，吃一堑长一智。咱们现在就去派出所报警，把证据交给警察叔叔，也能帮着抓骗子。"
    mom normal "It's enough that you know you were wrong. The money isn't much — learn from this. Let's go to the police station now and report it. Handing the evidence to the police officer can even help catch the scammers."

# game/ch02.rpy:185
translate english ch2_report_c073c5c9:

    # n "妈妈陪着阿狐到辖区派出所，反诈民警接待了他们，认真做了记录，还详细给阿狐讲了这类诈骗的常见套路。"
    n "Mom went with Ahu to the local police station, where an anti-fraud officer received them, carefully took notes, and explained the common patterns of this type of scam in detail."

# game/ch02.rpy:186
translate english ch2_report_e6a404ad:

    # police serious "同学，你遇到的就是典型的短视频点赞返利诈骗，专门针对你们中小学生。你能主动告诉家长、来报警，做得很对。以后记住，凡是让你先交钱的网络兼职，全是诈骗。"
    police serious "Classmate, what you ran into is a typical short-video like-rebate scam, aimed specifically at primary and secondary students. You did the right thing by telling your parents and coming to report it. Remember: any online job that makes you pay money first is a scam."

# game/ch02.rpy:187
translate english ch2_report_cb1ec764:

    # n "过了两周，班主任在班会上说，警方打掉了一个这类诈骗的小团伙，就是用「点赞赚零花钱」的名义骗学生的钱。"
    n "Two weeks later, the head teacher said at a class meeting that the police had taken down a small gang running this exact scam, tricking students out of money in the name of \"earn pocket money by liking.\""

# game/ch02.rpy:188
translate english ch2_report_892d1f5f:

    # think serious "虽然损失了零花钱，但知道骗子被抓了，我报警是有意义的。"
    think serious "I may have lost my pocket money, but knowing the scammers were caught makes reporting it worthwhile."

# game/ch02.rpy:190
translate english ch2_report_6dc2ce99:

    # police laugh "你不慎落入骗局造成财产损失，但能主动告知家长、及时报警维权，既配合了警方工作，也彻底认清了诈骗套路，学会了正确的处理方式！"
    police laugh "You accidentally fell into the scam and lost money, but you told your parents, reported it promptly, cooperated with the police, and fully understood the scam's routine — you've learned the right way to handle it!"

# game/ch02.rpy:205
translate english ch2_tell_teacher_73c51755:

    # n "阿狐慌了神，不知道该怎么办，第一时间给班主任发了语音，声音还有点发颤。"
    n "Panicking and unsure what to do, Ahu sent a voice message to his head teacher right away, his voice still trembling."

# game/ch02.rpy:206
translate english ch2_tell_teacher_c4dc093e:

    # n "老师很快打回电话，先安抚了他的情绪，让他别着急，然后叮嘱他保留好所有聊天记录和转账截图，千万别删。"
    n "The teacher quickly called back, first calming him down and telling him not to worry, then reminding him to keep all the chat records and transfer screenshots — don't delete anything."

# game/ch02.rpy:207
translate english ch2_tell_teacher_5e691454:

    # teacher serious "别慌，先保留好所有聊天记录和转账截图，千万别删。老师这就联系你妈妈，咱们一起处理。"
    teacher serious "Don't panic. Keep all the chat records and transfer screenshots — don't delete a thing. I'll contact your mom right away and we'll handle this together."

# game/ch02.rpy:209
translate english ch2_tell_teacher_4643f245:

    # n "当天晚上，班主任特意给阿狐妈妈打了电话，说明了情况。第二天周末，妈妈陪着阿狐去派出所报了警。"
    n "That evening, the head teacher called Ahu's mom to explain the situation. The next day on the weekend, Mom went with Ahu to the police station to report it."

# game/ch02.rpy:210
translate english ch2_tell_teacher_5aa0444e:

    # n "周一上学，老师专门在班级里提了这件事，没有说出阿狐的名字，只是再次提醒全班同学，绝对不能相信点赞返利的兼职，遇到问题一定要找家长和老师。"
    n "On Monday at school, the teacher brought it up in class without naming Ahu, reminding everyone once again to never trust like-rebate jobs, and to always go to parents or teachers when problems arise."

# game/ch02.rpy:211
translate english ch2_tell_teacher_ea821752:

    # think normal "虽然被骗了钱，但因为老师的帮助，我很快就稳住了情绪，也记住了这次教训。"
    think normal "I lost some money, but with my teacher's help I quickly calmed down and will remember this lesson."

# game/ch02.rpy:213
translate english ch2_tell_teacher_005c689f:

    # police serious "你被骗后没有独自慌乱，而是主动求助老师，在师长的指导下正确处理了问题。虽然有财产损失，但学会了遇到问题及时求助的正确方式！"
    police serious "After being scammed, you didn't panic alone — you sought help from your teacher and handled it correctly under guidance. There was a loss, but you've learned the right way to ask for help when trouble strikes!"

